# Power connector 0: an 8-pin EPS plug in its header (pc_epoxy_black), 5.3 m long (x) and 2.3 m deep (z) at the foot (250 times life size), with its wire bundle,
# four yellow (pc_wire_yellow) and four black (pc_wire_black) wires 1 m thick, rising straight and then in a curve towards -z to y = 64, the ceiling. Mesh
# collider up to 7.5 m (the level cuts it), none above.
format 1

# The header and plug, then the two rows of wires as chains of capsules
